{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04070","headline":"奉和圣制幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尚书列侯第，外戚近臣家。\n飞栋临青绮，回舆转翠华。\n日交当户树，泉漾满池花。\n圆顶图嵩石，方流拥魏沙。\n豫游今听履，侍从昔鸣笳。\n自有天文降，无劳访海槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}